      "edition": "Friday 6 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury doubt",
          "heading": "Tom Curry major injury doubt for Australia Test, Ben Curry in line",
          "body": "Tom Curry is understood to have pulled up injured during Wednesday's full-bore training session, and the nature of the problem has not been disclosed. Fears remain he could miss the whole November campaign, a blow after Guy Pepper and Sam Underhill were already sidelined. Borthwick names his team later on Friday, with twin brother Ben, who has not played for England since 2025, under strong consideration for No. 7."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Fiji name ex-England star Nathan Hughes for France clash",
