    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-06",
      "edition": "Friday 6 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Galthié names Gourgues first start as Dupont captains injury-hit France against Fiji",
          "body": "Les Bleus open their European leg against Fiji in Lyon on Saturday without Meafou, Flament, Jalibert, Brau-Boirie and Thomas Ramos, and Oscar Jegou was ruled out with a rib injury picked up in training. Dupont captains the side from number nine, ousting Maxime Lucu to the bench, and Kalvin Gourgues makes his first start after four appearances off the bench. Théo Attissogbe covers full-back for Ramos, and Esteban Capilla is set to make his Test debut from the replacements."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "England's Tom Curry faces major injury fears before Australia Test",
