      "edition": "Friday 6 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Sean Jansen starts at No. 8 for Ireland with Doris, Conan sidelined",
          "body": "Connacht back-rower Sean Jansen gets a run of starts this month after injuries to Caelan Doris and Jack Conan opened the No. 8 shirt. The New Zealand-born forward made his Ireland debut against Japan in July, and his man-of-the-match display earned him a bench spot against the All Blacks in Auckland. \"I'm not just here to fill a jersey because a few boys are injured,\" he says."
