          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Quesada rests Fischetti, moves Capuozzo to wing for Springboks clash",
          "body": "Gonzalo Quesada has moved Danilo Fischetti to the bench after six consecutive starts, judging that four more in a row would be too much. Alessandro Fusco gets the nod at scrum-half over Stephen Varney, who has been travelling back and forth from England. Ange Capuozzo shifts to the right wing after limited time training with the squad, and Domingo Miotti, newly joined, is not expected to play against South Africa or in the Argentina match that follows, Quesada said at the team announcement."
