      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Officiating caveat",
          "heading": "Jeff Wilson says only bizarre officiating can stop All Blacks against Scotland",
          "body": "All Blacks great Jeff Wilson is 'pretty confident' New Zealand can go through November unbeaten, and the only thing he can see derailing them at Murrayfield on Saturday is officiating. Scotland have never beaten the All Blacks, yet in 2025 they trailed 17-0 before a McKenzie cameo gave the visitors a 25-17 win. Wilson also credits the injuries with widening the squad and keeping players fresher."
