          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Contepomi shuffles 12 Pumas starters, recalling Juan Cruz Mallia for Ireland",
          "body": "Felipe Contepomi has made 12 changes to the Argentina team for Friday's Nations Championship test against Ireland, the lineup following the 28-28 draw with Australia in September. The headline call is fullback Juan Cruz Mallia, who returns for the first time in almost a year after ruptured knee ligaments from a late tackle by England's Tom Curry. Contepomi wants a more polished unit across three Tests, against Ireland, Italy and France, and says discipline will be key after Argentina were reduced to 13 men late against Australia."
