          "heading": "Eddie Jones drafts in former Wales flanker Kingsley Jones for Cardiff",
          "body": "Kingsley Jones, the former Wales flanker who left Canada's head coaching job last year, has spent the week in Japan's camp ahead of Saturday's match in Cardiff. Japan's head coach says the role is simple: \"He's in camp, just watching what we're doing and feeding back on how we can improve.\" Eddie Jones also admits he already has a very good idea of how Wales will play, and Japan are still chasing a first win on Welsh soil."
